cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the
  metadata from this file.
title: >-
  PSO parallel optimization: a corrected and verified
  serial, MPI data-parallel, and island-model
  particle swarm optimizer
type: software
authors:
  - name: PSO modernization contributors
version: 1.0.0
date-released: '2026-09-12'
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Provides a verified serial baseline, a corrected MPI
  data-parallel implementation, and a ring-topology island
  model with
  optional OpenMP hybrid execution. Uses Clerc-Kennedy
  constriction semantics, per-particle deterministic RNG
  streams bound to global particle indices, a unified
  fixed-function-evaluation budget protocol, single-line
  pso_v1 result records, best-so-far convergence sidecars,
  and reproducible experiment manifests with paired-bootstrap
  confidence intervals and Mann-Whitney U testing.
keywords:
  - particle swarm optimization
  - MPI
  - OpenMP
  - island model
  - benchmark methodology
